610657971227394868", "create_time": 1771994396, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7610445594053692706", "content": "很多人问线面好不好吃，这关乎每个人的口味和喜好不同。对于福州人来说，线面已经是仪式感。讲究的人家，过生日、出远门、婚礼、正月初一等等，都吃太平面，重要性可能类似北方的饺子。生病的大人小孩也给吃线面，据说因为容易消化。但是福州线面在抖音被普及居然是因为容易繁殖哈哈哈！", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "5", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA-qbOLLr6rNHrZIpNhYIrybGS2ecV2JYXD76XI3gdhy8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA-qbOLLr6rNHrZIpNhYIrybGS2ecV2JYXD76XI3gdhy8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyml756bpgaj", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "离啊个哩", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_o0IgPh8IwhViDWR9PV6GvAaZiA4U0xAhBEUAA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419732859}, {"comment_id": "7611746545726653221", "create_time": 1772247851, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7610445594053692706", "content": "福建嫁安徽，福建线面和安徽挂面，我家娃爱吃安徽挂面，不吃线面。可能是我小时候怕线面，那是真吃不完，一坨它一泡又变成一碗[捂脸]其实线面养胃适合小孩。有一次我把线面带去安徽，他们看了很惊讶。同样是拉出来的面，我们的却细如发丝。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "2", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA93-G-MJZIvRUp63R5TsuDr3XecGbe9mHDHCLFoZdfBY", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA93-G-MJZIvRUp63R5TsuDr3XecGbe9mHDHCLFoZdfBY", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "969209040815.", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "[ffeedd[b]]往事如烟", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_e72ce8862db0cb1f27c6823fe9d24a70.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419732859}, {"comment_id": "7610665164673172283", "create_time": 1771996071, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7610445594053692706", "content": "来个福州本地人说一下好吃吗？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "58", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAArZjb6paupn0ff0EYA2N-WbrjT6qRlvPd3GI7C701LZM4FvNk2bbWdEP5Bku4aXUk", "sec_uid":